borrowed, constructor-sealed evidence from which separately observed entry
lengths and SHA-256 digests may be checked before a future decoder sees bytes.

The Import fixture covers all 16 stored/compressed, extras, and ZIP64
combinations, rejected source/path purposes, unknown required features, missing
